---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<Layout title="About" description="About Kunhee Ryu, a researcher at the Human Artificial Intelligence Research Lab at Yonsei University.">
  <section class="page-head wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>Kunhee Ryu</h1>
    <p>I’m a researcher at the Human Artificial Intelligence Research Lab at Yonsei University.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="about-content wrap">
    <aside class="about-index">
      <span class="eyebrow">Currently</span>
      <p>Researcher<br />HAIR Lab<br />Yonsei University</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email} ↗</a>
      <div class="about-socials">
        <a href={profile.links.scholar} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Scholar ↗</a>
        <a href={profile.links.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
        <a href={profile.links.orcid} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ORCID ↗</a>
        <a href={profile.links.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="about-prose">
      <h2>Background</h2>
      <p>I joined the Human Artificial Intelligence Research Lab as an undergraduate research assistant in 2021. I completed my B.S. in Creative Technology Management at Yonsei’s Underwood International College in 2023, followed by an M.S. in Innovation in 2025, advised by Professor Keeheon Lee.</p>
      <p>My master’s research combined document retrieval and knowledge graphs for biomedical question answering. Since then, I have worked on agents for meta-analysis, how people verify AI answers, checkpoint selection, and the evaluation of sequential edits.</p>
      <h2>Research interests</h2>
      <p>My current work examines how language models use evidence and how to evaluate their decisions. I use controlled experiments to study model behavior, and interaction logs and interviews to understand how people check AI answers.</p>
      <p>I’m also interested in learned representations that help agents predict the consequences of their actions. <a class="inline-link" href="/directions/">Research directions ↗</a></p>
      <a class="button" href="/cv/">View my CV <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
